    "All data inside the Documents, Library and tmp folders of %@ will be erased. This cannot be undone.\nQuit the app on the simulator first, otherwise some data may remain.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All data inside the Documents, Library and tmp folders of %@ will be erased. This cannot be undone.\nQuit the app on the simulator first, otherwise some data may remain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将清空 %@ 的 Documents、Library、tmp 等目录中的全部数据，此操作不可撤销。\n请先在模拟器上退出该 App，否则可能残留数据。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "將清除 %@ 的 Documents、Library、tmp 等檔案夾中的所有資料，此操作無法還原。\n請先在模擬器上結束該 App，否則可能殘留資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
